{"seq":4,"slug":"educational-assessment","title":"教育评估与测量","stage":"DONE","category":"education","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-assessment","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 教育评估与测量 简介\n\n教育评估与测量是教育科学中最具技术性和方法论严谨性的分支。科学的评估和测量工具不仅能够公正地衡量学习成果，还能为教学改进、课程优化和教育政策制定提供可靠的证据支持。\n\n本知识库系统讲解教育评估的理论基础、测试编制技术和教育测量方法，面向教育评估专家、考试开发人员和教育数据分析师。\n\n第1章**评估理论**建立教育评估的理论基础，介绍评估的基本概念、效度与信度的核心理论以及评估范式的历史演进。\n\n第2章**测试编制**聚焦测试工具开发的实践技术，涵盖题目编制、测试蓝图设计和题目分析的核心方法。\n\n第3章**教育测量**深入讲解教育测量的数学理论基础，包括经典测量理论、项目反应理论和标准设定方法。\n\n建议读者从第1章的理论基础开始，建立对评估质量的判断力，再通过第2章和第3章掌握测试开发和数据分析的专业技能。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"assessment-theory","title":"评估理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-assessment/assessment-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"assessment-fundamentals","title":"教育评估基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-assessment/assessment-theory/assessment-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"validity-reliability","title":"效度与信度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-assessment/assessment-theory/validity-reliability"},{"seq":3,"slug":"assessment-paradigms","title":"评估范式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-assessment/assessment-theory/assessment-paradigms"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"test-construction","title":"测试编制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-assessment/test-construction","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"item-writing","title":"试题编写","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-assessment/test-construction/item-writing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"test-blueprinting","title":"测试蓝图与组卷","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-assessment/test-construction/test-blueprinting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"item-analysis","title":"试题分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-assessment/test-construction/item-analysis"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"educational-measurement","title":"教育测量","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-assessment/educational-measurement","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"classical-test-theory","title":"经典测量理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-assessment/educational-measurement/classical-test-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"item-response-theory","title":"项目反应理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-assessment/educational-measurement/item-response-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"standard-setting","title":"标准设定方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/educational-assessment/educational-measurement/standard-setting"}]}]}